{"ordinal":13496,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452845281284","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Death_0a34b8d","source":"Greatmother: Ты всех обрёк на смерть, хахахаха!","target":"Greatmother: I-ai osândit pe toți la moarte, ha-ha-ha-ha!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13497,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452845281283","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Death_026faf4","source":"Greatmother: После меня придут и добьют тебя и всю твою шоблу.","target":"Greatmother: După mine vor veni alții și vă vor termina pe tine și toată șleahta ta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13498,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452845281282","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Death_0454ea2","source":"Greatmother: Да ты стреляй.","target":"Greatmother: Hai, trage.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13499,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452845281281","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_DontShoot_0fb0ea3","source":"Greatmother: Зараза, как бы яйца не отложил в мозг.","target":"Greatmother: Fir-ar să fie, să nu-mi depună ouă în creier.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13500,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452845281280","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_DontShoot_02dee2b","source":"Greatmother: Уши-то у меня самый здоровый орган в теле.","target":"Greatmother: Urechile sunt cel mai sănătos organ din trupul meu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13501,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086985","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_DontShoot_0d7ea7e","source":"Greatmother: А тебе насекомые не залетали в рот или ещё куда?","target":"Greatmother: Ție nu ți-au intrat niciodată insecte în gură sau în altă parte?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13502,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086984","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_DontShoot_022bdbc","source":"Greatmother: У меня и фотографий не осталось уже. Мне и на эту плевать, но пусть полежит, что ли.","target":"Greatmother: Nici fotografii nu mi-au mai rămas. De asta nu-mi pasă, dar las-o acolo, mă rog.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13503,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086983","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_DontShoot_04de354","source":"Greatmother: Можно я у себя оставлю?","target":"Greatmother: Pot s-o păstrez eu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13504,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086982","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_DontShoot_0827b0a","source":"Greatmother: Не то что в моём возрасте так, а при жизни современной так дрянно чувствовать себя будем.","target":"Greatmother: Nu doar la vârsta mea e așa; cu viața din ziua de azi, toți o să ne simțim ca dracu’.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13505,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086981","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_DontShoot_0056077","source":"Greatmother: Недавно фразу такую услышала. Если ничего не болит, значит, уже умер.","target":"Greatmother: Am auzit de curând o vorbă: dacă nu te doare nimic, înseamnă că ești deja mort.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13506,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086980","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_DontShoot_039a0c8","source":"Greatmother: Много ли раз ты ошибался? Берешь ли ты на себя ответственность за такие убийства?","target":"Greatmother: De câte ori ai greșit? Îți asumi răspunderea pentru omorurile astea?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13507,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086979","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_DontShoot_07cabf9","source":"Greatmother: Было бы страшно ошибиться и случайно убить человека.","target":"Greatmother: Ar fi groaznic să greșești și să omori din întâmplare un om.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13508,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086978","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_DontShoot_0b3e34c","source":"Greatmother: Конечно, какой же это признак?","target":"Greatmother: Sigur, ce fel de semn mai e și ăsta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13509,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086977","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_DontShoot_0608507","source":"Greatmother: Но я бы еще пострадала какое-то время, хахаха.","target":"Greatmother: Dar eu aș mai suferi o vreme, ha-ha-ha.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13510,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452841086976","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_DontShoot_01fa1a3","source":"Greatmother: Ты бы мог меня, конечно, избавить от страданий.","target":"Greatmother: Sigur, ai putea să mă scapi de suferință.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13511,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892681","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_DontShoot_0afea5e","source":"Greatmother: Какой смысл стрелять в больного человека?","target":"Greatmother: Ce rost are să împuști un om bolnav?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13512,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892680","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_DontShoot_018da98","source":"Greatmother: Ты же не всегда держишь в руках это своё ружьё, а?","target":"Greatmother: Nu ții mereu pușca aia în mână, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13513,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892679","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_DontShoot_008dade","source":"Greatmother: Во всех оружием тыкать — так каждый начнёт на тебя косо смотреть.","target":"Greatmother: Dacă îndrepți arma spre toată lumea, fiecare o să înceapă să se uite chiorâș la tine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13514,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892678","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_DontShoot_02164a8","source":"Greatmother: Ты с этой ерундой поосторожнее обращайся.","target":"Greatmother: Ai grijă cum umbli cu prostia aia.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-342.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13515,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892677","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_Gun_0c3f053","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13516,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892676","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_Gun_02c7df4","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13517,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892675","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_Gun_0d2cdfe","source":"Greatmother: Ненавижу этих тварей. А тут ещё и в ухо заполз, гнида.","target":"Greatmother: Urăsc lighioanele astea. Iar acum mi-a intrat una și în ureche, scârboșenia.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13518,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892674","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_Gun_07fdde6","source":"Greatmother: Да меня-то что ловить, я не денусь никуда! Таракана держи!","target":"Greatmother: Ce să mă prinzi pe mine? Nu plec nicăieri! Prinde gândacul!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13519,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892673","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_Gun_0b7c142","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13520,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452836892672","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_Gun_072c365","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13521,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698376","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_Gun_089ac8f","source":"Greatmother: Ой, смешно стало даже.","target":"Greatmother: Vai, că-mi vine și să râd.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13522,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698375","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_Gun_020ad5a","source":"Greatmother: Да какая аура, сынок? Тебя надурили на деньги, а ты как простак повёлся.","target":"Greatmother: Ce aură, fiule? Te-au tras pe sfoară și ți-au luat banii, iar tu ai pus botul ca un prostănac.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13523,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698374","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_Gun_0ef408f","source":"Greatmother: Что? Аура?","target":"Greatmother: Ce? Aura?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13524,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698373","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_Gun_0e626c8","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13525,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698372","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_Gun_0f023bd","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13526,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698371","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_Gun_04ebc29","source":"Greatmother: Ну что, излечишь добрую женщину?","target":"Greatmother: Ei, o vindeci pe femeia asta cumsecade?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13527,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698370","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_Gun_07e3b1e","source":"Greatmother: АХАХАХА, вот и лекарство от всех болезней!","target":"Greatmother: A-HA-HA-HA, iată leacul pentru toate bolile!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13528,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698369","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_Gun_05c6869","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13529,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452832698368","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_Gun_0fc141e","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13530,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452828504071","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_Gun_002c493","source":"Greatmother: Или это вообще рак.","target":"Greatmother: Sau poate e chiar cancer.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13531,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452828504070","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_Gun_0c999d9","source":"Greatmother: Наверно, сосуды, которые постоянно лопаются, перестают восстанавливаться.","target":"Greatmother: Probabil vasele de sânge care tot plesnesc nu se mai refac.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13532,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452828504069","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_Gun_05294e8","source":"Greatmother: Последние года три стала видеть хуже.","target":"Greatmother: De vreo trei ani văd tot mai prost.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13533,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452828504068","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_Gun_071e7e0","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13534,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452828504067","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_Gun_0c1f8c4","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13535,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452828504066","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_Gun_066a708","source":"Greatmother: Да ты не переживай, я этими руками ещё и за себя постою, и вас, задохликов, спасу.","target":"Greatmother: Nu-ți face griji, cu mâinile astea încă mă pot apăra și pe mine, și vă pot salva și pe voi, slăbănogilor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13536,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452828504065","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_Gun_0cee103","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13537,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452828504064","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_Gun_06cb3f6","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13538,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452824309765","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_Gun_07fd2af","source":"Greatmother: Нож в спину — вот лучшее решение проблемы. Или отравить чем-нибудь.","target":"Greatmother: Un cuțit în spate — asta-i cea mai bună rezolvare. Sau să-i otrăvești cu ceva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13539,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452824309764","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_Gun_0a310c6","source":"Greatmother: Ружьём уже не решаются такие вопросы, ты чего?","target":"Greatmother: Problemele astea nu se mai rezolvă cu pușca, ce-ai pățit?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-343.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13540,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452824309763","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_0aa7609","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13541,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452824309762","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_01451a5","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13542,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452824309761","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_09da183","source":"Greatmother: Ой, бля, лови его! Лови, убей!","target":"Greatmother: Vai, futu-i, prinde-l! Prinde-l, omoară-l!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13543,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452824309760","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_070b6a8","source":"Greatmother: ...","target":"Greatmother: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13544,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452820115463","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Ears_0fb483e","source":"Greatmother: По ночам я слышу какой-то шорох. Как будто скребётся кто.","target":"Greatmother: Noaptea aud un foșnet. De parcă ar zgâria cineva ceva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13545,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452820115462","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_0ed980a","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13546,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452820115461","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_021b2f8","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13547,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452820115460","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_09fbbde","source":"Greatmother: А почему меня так плохо видно? Только пятна, пятна, пятна.","target":"Greatmother: Dar de ce abia mă văd? Doar pete, pete, pete.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13548,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452820115459","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_05e64f3","source":"Greatmother: ...","target":"Greatmother: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13549,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452820115458","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_07dfc11","source":"Greatmother: Давай, почему нет?","target":"Greatmother: Hai, de ce nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13550,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452820115457","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Photo_0b69287","source":"Greatmother: Давно меня не фотографировали.","target":"Greatmother: Nu m-a mai fotografiat nimeni de mult.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
