{"ordinal":13552,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921161","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_0f78805","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13553,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921160","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_02a7f66","source":"Greatmother: Много чего перепробовала, как-то не помогает.","target":"Greatmother: Am încercat tot felul de lucruri, dar nimic nu prea ajută.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13554,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921159","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_094a59d","source":"Greatmother: Зудит постоянно. Уж не знаю, чё и делать.","target":"Greatmother: Mă mănâncă tot timpul. Nici nu mai știu ce să fac.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13555,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921158","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_00fdc19","source":"Greatmother: ...","target":"Greatmother: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13556,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921157","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Armpit_0e92212","source":"Greatmother: Да старуха я уже. Тело это ни к чёрту.","target":"Greatmother: Sunt deja o babă. Trupul ăsta nu mai e bun de nimic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13557,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921156","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_0d4417b","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13558,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921155","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_0a654bf","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13559,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921154","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_0fc7ea9","source":"Greatmother: Что будешь делать?","target":"Greatmother: Ce ai de gând să faci?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13560,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921153","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_056f413","source":"Greatmother: ...","target":"Greatmother: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13561,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452815921152","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_00afb11","source":"Greatmother: Не знаю, как ты будешь определять, Гость ли я.","target":"Greatmother: Nu știu cum o să stabilești dacă sunt Musafir.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13562,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726856","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Eyes_033f348","source":"Greatmother: У меня всегда лопнувшие сосуды в глазах.","target":"Greatmother: Am mereu vase de sânge sparte în ochi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13563,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726855","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_04d8be1","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13564,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726854","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_0899141","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13565,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726853","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_004231c","source":"Greatmother: Больно и неприятно.","target":"Greatmother: Doare și e neplăcut.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13566,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726852","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_00efcb2","source":"Greatmother: Я уж не помню, как эта болезнь называется, но у меня теперь ногти отходят.","target":"Greatmother: Nu mai țin minte cum se cheamă boala asta, dar acum mi se desprind unghiile.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13567,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726851","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_0c4fe85","source":"Greatmother: ...","target":"Greatmother: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13568,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726850","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_0c6b6d2","source":"Greatmother: Старость не радость, сынок.","target":"Greatmother: Bătrânețea nu-i o bucurie, fiule.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13569,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726849","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Hands_0a3b396","source":"Greatmother: Вот с этим у нас будут проблемы.","target":"Greatmother: Cu asta o să avem probleme.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13570,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452811726848","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_041ec65","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13571,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452807532552","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_0e3107c","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13572,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452807532551","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_0d0a135","source":"Greatmother: Захотела такая старая карга, как я, виниры, убивать теперь? Доделают потом.","target":"Greatmother: Ce, dacă o babă hârcă precum mine și-a dorit fațete dentare, acum trebuie s-o omori? Le vor termina mai târziu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13573,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452807532550","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_07765eb","source":"Greatmother: И чего?","target":"Greatmother: Și ce dacă?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13574,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452807532549","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Greatmother_Teeth_0e240a8","source":"Greatmother: ...","target":"Greatmother: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-344.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
